+	 * alt-tab, close-then-focus-next and the session all read, so it
+	 * cannot be bent to put a kept-on-top window last. Paint order is
+	 * derived here instead, as a stable partition: windows in the normal
+	 * layer first, then the kept-on-top layer, each in focus order. That
+	 * is what lets an unpinned window be focused and still sit under a
